WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.613
Window functions are powerful because they preserve
row detail GROUP BY

00:00:05.627 --> 00:00:11.389
usually reduces multiple rows to one grouped row A
window function

00:00:11.415 --> 00:00:16.849
can calculate a group average rank running total or
previous value while still returning the

00:00:16.876 --> 00:00:22.680
individual row This is why windows are ideal when
you need both detail

00:00:22.693 --> 00:00:24.443
and context in the same result
